package rowview

// readerRoles is the checked-in allowlist of the non-test Go files that name one of the three tables of the
// view column (CHAOS-8863). The census test (census_test.go) fails when a file names a table and is not listed here,
// and when a listed file no longer names one. A new READER must be listed with its role, which is the point where
// its author decides which view the read takes.
//
// Roles:
//
//	reader-sum    sums rows of several work scopes: takes OrgPredicate (the readers of PR2 of CHAOS-8863);
//	reader-nosum  reads rows with no sum across scopes (a listing, or one key);
